{"id":56,"flavor":[{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"An agile Pokémon that lives in trees. It angers easily and will not hesitate to attack anything."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"If one gets angry, all the others around it will get angry, so silence is a rare visitor in a troop of Mankey."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"The smallest of things could cause it to lose its temper. Because it doesn’t hold in its stress, this Pokémon can live a long time."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Its raging tires it out and causes it to fall asleep, but the anger resonating in its dreams causes it to wake up—which infuriates it all over again."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It can spontaneously become enraged. Everyone near it clears out as it rampages, and the resulting loneliness makes it angrier still."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"When Mankey starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign that it is becoming angry. However, because it goes into a towering rage almost instantly, it is impossible for anyone to flee its wrath."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It lives in treetop colonies. If one becomes enraged, the whole colony rampages for no reason."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It’s unsafe to approach if it gets violently enraged for no reason and can’t distinguish friends from foes."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"It is extremely ill-tempered. Groups of them will attack any handy target for no reason."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"Extremely quick to anger. It could be docile one moment, then thrashing away the next instant."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"Light and agile on its feet, and ferocious in temperament. When angered, it flies into an uncontrollable frenzy."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"When it starts shaking and its nasal breathing turns rough, it’s a sure sign of anger. However, since this happens instantly, there is no time to flee."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It lives in groups in the treetops. If it loses sight of its group, it becomes infuriated by its loneliness."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Vital Spirit","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is full of vitality, and that prevents it from falling asleep."},{"name":"Anger Point","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon is angered when it takes a critical hit, and that maxes its Attack stat."},{"name":"Defiant","hidden":true,"description":"If the Pokémon has any stat lowered by an opposing Pokémon, its Attack stat will be boosted sharply."}],"eggGroups":["Field"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"mountain","color":"Brown","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":56,"name":"Mankey","condition":null,"children":[{"id":57,"name":"Primeape","condition":"Lv. 28","children":[{"id":979,"name":"Annihilape","condition":"Use Rage Fist ×20","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,43],[1,116],[1,343],[5,154],[8,67],[12,69],[17,207],[22,238],[26,372],[29,37],[33,370],[36,103],[40,707],[44,200],[48,515]],"machine":[512,34,280,339,523,370,174,91,38,409,89,227,283,203,263,7,374,411,264,441,270,8,808,67,490,118,200,315,398,182,240,156,179,157,317,184,402,421,214,180,707,444,164,241,129,36,269,851,168,675,9,85,369,253],"egg":[251,68,174,227,400,180],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me5-42","name":"Mankey","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity":"Common","number":"42","artist":null,"small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-42/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-42/large"},{"id":"sv10-90","name":"Mankey","set":"Destined Rivals","date":"2025-05-30","rarity":"Common","number":"90","artist":null,"img":"sv10/90"},{"id":"sv8-98","name":"Mankey","set":"Surging Sparks","date":"2024-11-08","rarity":"Common","number":"98","artist":null,"img":"sv8/98"},{"id":"sv4pt5-45","name":"Mankey","set":"Paldean Fates